{"product_id":"detox-yourself-feel-the-difference-in-7-days","title":"Detox Yourself: Feel the Difference in 7 Days","description":"\u003cp\u003ePresenting an easy, healthy way to rejuvenate the body and de-stress the mind in order to look and feel fantastic, this highly effective, tried-and-tested detox program will produce noticeable results in just seven days. With a range of tasty new recipes, menu plans, and shopping lists, as well as hints and tips on how to live a normal life while detoxing, the guide reveals everything needed to feel cleansed, revitalized, and energized. Whether one wants to become a beach babe, banish the winter blues, or look fab in that little black dress, this detox can help those dreams become reality.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 203\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Jane Scrivner\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780749928285\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 256\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45803733581977,"sku":"15RB-4-9780749928285","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68f38df806dff_Detox_Yourself-_Feel_the_Difference_in_7_Days_Jane_Scrivner.jpg?v=1760808544","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/detox-yourself-feel-the-difference-in-7-days","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}